# Jira — NEWS project

When creating, searching, updating, or commenting on Jira work for this repo, use the **NEWS** project only (unless the user explicitly names another project).

## Connection

- **MCP server**: `Atlassian-MCP-Server` (project) / `user-Atlassian-MCP-Server` (user-level)
- **Site**: https://informedcrew.atlassian.net
- **cloudId**: `ebcd227d-1f6d-4a54-a6d7-cfe70e377a50`
- **Project key**: `NEWS`
- **Project name**: Informed News
- **Project id**: `10035`

## Issue types (team-managed)

| Name | id |
|------|-----|
| Epic | 10051 |
| Story | 10053 |
| Task | 10052 |
| Feature | 10054 |
| Bug | 10055 |
| Subtask | 10050 |

## Conventions

- Prefer JQL scoped with `project = NEWS`.
- Pass `cloudId` on every Atlassian MCP call.
- Do not use HARN, KIND, TASK, or SCRUM for Informed News work.
- After editing `.cursor/mcp.json`, reload MCP / re-auth if tools show `needsAuth`.
